{
  "id": 8834819424455,
  "title": "Personalized Wildlife Deer Couple in Forest Comforter",
  "handle": "personalized-wildlife-deer-couple-in-forest-comforter-0b240654a2-0b240654a2",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the warmth of the wild with this beautiful wildlife-themed bedding. Featuring a photorealistic digital collage of a deer couple nestled in the forest surrounded by wildflowers and butterflies, this quilt brings the cozy serene spirit of nature directly to your bedroom. Designed as a meaningful gift for couples, hunting enthusiasts, or families, it serves as a daily reminder of love and partnership.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable text input, allowing you to add names, dates, or custom sayings to make it a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Factual Product Type:</strong> This high-quality Quilt Set comes with an optional addition of 2 or 4 pillowcases to complete your bedding ensemble.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Materials:</strong> Crafted with a comfortable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester on the outer layer, filled with soft high-quality silk floss.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor warmth across all seasons, making it ideal for beds, sofas, backyard lounging, camping, or picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple to clean, machine washable in cold water, and dries quickly to return to its fluffy texture.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Deer Couple-02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Deer Couple Hunting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
